</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 min-h-screen antialiased flex flex-col">

  <!-- Header / Navigation Bar -->
  <header class="bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-slate-700">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-inner border border-red-500">
          雄
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
            高雄中學 113-1 高一第一次段考
            <span class="text-xs bg-red-600/80 text-white font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">數學科</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">標準試卷與全解析互動系統 (高一上)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action & Mode Controllers -->
      <div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2.5">
        <!-- Mode Switcher -->
        <div class="flex bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-xs font-medium">
          <button id="modeExamBtn" onclick="switchMode('exam')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-all bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-stopwatch mr-1"></i> 模擬考試
          </button>
          <button id="modePracticeBtn" onclick="switchMode('practice')" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-all">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open-reader mr-1"></i> 練習與全解
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Timer Controls (Visible in Exam mode) -->
        <div id="timerContainer" class="flex items-center bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-200">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-amber-400 mr-2 text-sm"></i>
          <span id="timerText" class="font-mono font-bold text-sm text-amber-300">70:00</span>
          <button id="toggleTimerBtn" onclick="toggleTimer()" title="暫停/繼續計時" class="ml-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-pause"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Print Action -->
        <button onclick="handlePrintDialog()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-print"></i> 列印試卷
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex-grow">
    
    <!-- Printable Formal Exam Header -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 mb-6 exam-container">
      <div class="text-center pb-5 border-b-2 border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="serif-title text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-900 mb-1">
          高雄市立高雄高級中學 113 學年度第一學期 第一次段考
        </h2>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-2">
          <span>考科：數學科</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>適用年級：高一</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>考試時間：70 分鐘</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Student & Score meta panel -->
      <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm bg-slate-50 p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <label class="text-slate-600 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">班級：</label>
          <input type="text" id="studentClass" placeholder="例如：1年1班" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <label class="text-slate-600 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">座號：</label>
          <input type="text" id="studentSeat" placeholder="例如：25" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <label class="text-slate-600 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">姓名：</label>
          <input type="text" id="studentName" placeholder="請輸入姓名" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Notice for Exam -->
      <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-1">
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-600">考試說明：</p>
        <p>1. 本試卷共計：填充題 14 大題（共 18 小格，每格 5 分，計 90 分）、計算證明題 1 題（共 3 小題，計 10 分），滿分 100 分。</p>
        <p>2. 所有分數請化為最簡分數；作答時請將正確答案填入對應題號中。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Control Row for Interactive Mode -->
      <div class="no-print mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200" id="currentModeBadge">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> 模式：模擬考試測驗中
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500" id="answeredCounter">已作答 0 / 19 題</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button onclick="toggleAllSolutions()" id="toggleAllBtn" class="hidden text-xs bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 transition flex items-center gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down mr-1"></i> 全部解析展開
          </button>
          <button onclick="submitExam()" class="text-xs bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-medium px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> 交卷批改並評分
          </button>
          <button onclick="resetExam()" class="text-xs bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> 重置試卷
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Score Result Card (Initially Hidden) -->
      <div id="scoreReport" class="hidden mt-5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs text-indigo-200 font-medium">測驗成績結算報告</div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold mt-0.5 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="finalScore" class="text-yellow-400">0</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-300">/ 100 分</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1">
            <p><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check text-emerald-400 mr-1.5"></i>答對格數：<span id="correctCount" class="font-bold text-white">0</span> 格</p>
            <p><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-xmark text-rose-400 mr-1.5"></i>答錯格數：<span id="wrongCount" class="font-bold text-white">0</span> 格</p>
            <p><i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-amber-400 mr-1.5"></i>作答耗時：<span id="timeSpent" class="font-bold text-white">0 分 0 秒</span></p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="switchMode('practice')" class="text-xs bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-yellow-400 text-slate-900 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition shadow">
            查看所有題目詳細解答與步驟
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section I: 填充題 Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 mt-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-6 bg-red-700 rounded-full inline-block"></span>
        <h3 class="serif-title text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">一、填充題（14 題，共 90 分）</h3>
      </div>
      <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        每格 5 分
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Questions Container -->
    <div class="space-y-5" id="questionsContainer">

      <!-- Q1 -->
      <div class="question-card bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:border-slate-300" id="qcard-1">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex-grow">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 text-lg">1.</span>
              <p class="text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                下列哪些可為實數系 $\mathbb{R}$ 的子集之表示式？（多選）
              </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Options list -->
            <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="A" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(A)\;(0, 1)$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="B" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(B)\;[1, 0]$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="C" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(C)\;\{1, 0\}$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="D" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(D)\;\{1 < x < 5\}$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="E" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(E)\;\{\phi\}$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="F" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(F)\;[\frac{13}{6}]$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="checkbox" name="q1_opt" value="G" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 rounded">
                <span>$(G)\;|\frac{13}{6}|$</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="status-badge hidden text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded"></span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">配分: 5分</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Answer / Input Row -->
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="interactive-input-group flex items-center gap-2">
            <label class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">作答填寫：</label>
            <input type="text" id="input-q1" placeholder="填入選項代號，如 ABC" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded px-3 py-1.5 text-sm uppercase font-mono w-44 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none">
          </div>
          <div class="print-only">
            作答：<span class="print-input-line"></span>
          </div>
          <button onclick="toggleSingleSolution('sol-1')" class="solution-toggle-btn text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium flex items-center gap-1 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> <span>查看解析</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Solution Box -->
        <div id="sol-1" class="solution-box hidden mt-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">官方正解</span>
            <span>$A, B, C$ (或 $ABC$)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
            <p><strong>解析與觀念：</strong></p>
            <p>• $(A)\;(0, 1)$：為開區間，代表實數集合 $\{x \in \mathbb{R} \mid 0 < x < 1\}$，是實數系的子集。(正確)</p>
            <p>• $(B)\;[1, 0]$：閉區間定義為 $\{x \in \mathbb{R} \mid 1 \le x \le 0\}$，因為不存在實數同時滿足 $x \ge 1$ 且 $x \le 0$，故此區間為空集合 $\emptyset$。而空集合是任意集合的子集（包含實數系 $\mathbb{R}$）。(正確)</p>
            <p>• $(C)\;\{1, 0\}$：以條列法表示包含元素 $1$ 與 $0$ 的雙元素集合，此兩元素皆為實數，故為實數子集。(正確)</p>
            <p>• $(D)\;\{1 < x < 5\}$：集合建構式缺乏變數宣告（正確格式應寫為 $\{x \in \mathbb{R} \mid 1 < x < 5\}$），語法不完整。(不選)</p>
            <p>• $(E)\;\{\phi\}$：代表元素為空集合 $\emptyset$ 的單元素集合，其元素不是實數，非實數子集。(不選)</p>
            <p>• $(F), (G)$：高斯符號 $[\frac{13}{6}] = 2$、絕對值 $|\frac{13}{6}| = \frac{13}{6}$ 均為單一「數值」，並非「集合」。(不選)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q2 -->
      <div class="question-card bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:border-slate-300" id="qcard-2">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex-grow">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 text-lg">2.</span>
              <p class="text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                $p, q$ 為兩敘述，已知複合敘述 $p \lor q$、$p \rightarrow q$ 以及 $p \rightarrow \sim q$ 皆為真，試判斷 $p, q$ 之真偽，請選出正確的選項：
              </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Options list -->
            <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="radio" name="q2_opt" value="A" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                <span>(A) $p$ 為真、$q$ 為真</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="radio" name="q2_opt" value="B" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                <span>(B) $p$ 為真、$q$ 為假</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="radio" name="q2_opt" value="C" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                <span>(C) $p$ 為假、$q$ 為真</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer border border-slate-200">
                <input type="radio" name="q2_opt" value="D" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                <span>(D) $p$ 為假、$q$ 為假</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="status-badge hidden text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded"></span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">配分: 5分</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="interactive-input-group flex items-center gap-2">
            <label class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">作答填寫：</label>
            <input type="text" id="input-q2" placeholder="填入單選代號 (如 C)" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded px-3 py-1.5 text-sm uppercase font-mono w-40 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none">
          </div>
          <div class="print-only">
            作答：<span class="print-input-line"></span>
          </div>
          <button onclick="toggleSingleSolution('sol-2')" class="solution-toggle-btn text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium flex items-center gap-1 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> <span>查看解析</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div id="sol-2" class="solution-box hidden mt-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">官方正解</span>
            <span>$C$</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
            <p><strong>詳細步驟解析：</strong></p>
            <p>1. 考慮條件敘述之真值：$p \rightarrow q$ 為真，且 $p \rightarrow \sim q$ 為真。</p>
            <p>2. 若 $p$ 為真，則依定義其後項 $q$ 必須為真，同時 $\sim q$ 也必須為真，這產生矛盾（一個敘述不能同時為真又為假）。因此前提 $p$ 絕不可能為真，故 <strong>$p$ 必為「假」</strong>。</p>
            <p>3. 已知複合敘述 $p \lor q$ 為真。既然 $p$ 為假，則選言「或者」要成立，<strong>$q$ 必須為「真」</strong>。</p>
