          <div class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p><strong>對稱式化簡技巧：</strong></p>
            <p>有理化計算：</p>
            <p>$$\frac{1}{x} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}+\sqrt{2}} = \sqrt{3}-\sqrt{2}$$</p>
            <p>因此兩者之和為：</p>
            <p>$$x + \frac{1}{x} = (\sqrt{3}+\sqrt{2}) + (\sqrt{3}-\sqrt{2}) = 2\sqrt{3}$$</p>
            <p><strong>(1) 小題：</strong></p>
            <p>$$x^2 + \frac{1}{x^2} = \left(x+\frac{1}{x}\right)^2 - 2 = (2\sqrt{3})^2 - 2 = 12 - 2 = 10$$</p>
            <p><strong>(2) 小題：</strong></p>
            <p>將分子分母同時除以 $x^3$：</p>
            <p>$$\frac{x^5 - x^3 + x}{x^6 + 1} = \frac{\frac{x^5 - x^3 + x}{x^3}}{\frac{x^6 + 1}{x^3}} = \frac{x^2 - 1 + \frac{1}{x^2}}{x^3 + \frac{1}{x^3}}$$</p>
